<!doctype html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>الرائدة | الفائزين بالجوائز الكبرى</title>
    <style>
        @font-face {
            font-family: Ping;
            src: url('PingAR+LT-Regular.otf')
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: Ping;
            src: url('PingAR+LT-Bold.otf');
            font-weight: 700
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: Ping;
            src: url('PingAR+LT-Heavy.otf');
            font-weight: 800
        }

        :root {
            --navy: #00326d;
            --blue: #07439b;
            --sky: #93dafa;
            --gold: #edbf60;
            --ink: #102f59
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #e9eef5;
            font-family: Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink)
        }

        .poster {
            width: min(1080px, 100%);
            margin: 24px auto;
            background: #f8fbff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            isolation: isolate;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 60px #07295b20;
            border: 1px solid #d7e5f6;
        }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 58px 48px 162px;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 110%, #17579f 0%, #00326d 62%, #001d45 100%)
        }

        .hero:before,
        .hero:after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            border: 1px solid #89beef39;
            width: 520px;
            height: 520px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: -310px
        }

        .hero:before {
            left: -290px
        }

        .hero:after {
            right: -290px
        }

        .eyebrow {
            font-family: Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 3.4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #bcd8f2
        }

        .logo {
            width: 165px;
            max-width: 40%;
            height: auto;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
            display: block
        }

        .small-line {
            width: 48px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--gold);
            margin: 23px auto
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(39px, 6vw, 68px);
            line-height: 1.36;
            margin: 12px 0 3px;
            font-weight: 800
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 39px);
            color: #f6cf81;
            margin: 0 0 9px;
            font-weight: 700
        }

        /* English translations under both Arabic hero titles */
        .hero-title-en {
            font-family: Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(17px, 2.2vw, 23px);
            color: #d7e9fa;
            margin: 0 0 19px;
            line-height: 1.45;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .hero-subtitle-en {
            font-family: Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 21px);
            color: #c6def4;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.45;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .hero .english {
            font-family: Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: #c6def4;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 22px);
            direction: ltr
        }

        .hero .star {
            position: absolute;
            color: #cf9e46;
            font-size: 50px;
            opacity: .8
        }

        .star.a {
            top: 41%;
            left: 12%
        }

        .star.b {
            top: 54%;
            right: 11%
        }

        .star.c {
            top: 25%;
            left: 25%;
        }

        .crown {
            margin: 26px auto 3px;
            width: 90px;
            height: 84px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 20px #0002)
        }

        .content {
            position: relative;
            margin-top: -115px;
            padding: 0 48px 46px
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 19px;
            font: 600 13px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 2px
        }

        .winners {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.19fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            align-items: end;
            direction: ltr
        }

        .winner {
            position: relative;
            background: #fff;
            direction: rtl;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #dae5f0;
            border-radius: 26px;
            padding: 43px 14px 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px #001d4515;
            min-height: 346px
        }

        .winner.first {
            min-height: 390px;
            padding-top: 52px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff9e8 0%, #fff 90%);
            border: 2px solid #e4b75e;
            box-shadow: 0 17px 38px #8b67252a
        }

        .medal {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            margin: -18px auto 16px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 65px;
            height: 65px;
            font: 800 27px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: #fff;
            border: 5px double #fff9;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px #002d5b28
        }

        .silver {
            background: linear-gradient(125deg, #8b9baf, #e0e7ef, #879ab2)
        }

        .gold {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ad7220, #ffdf79, #ad7220);
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            font-size: 34px
        }

        .bronze {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9e4a22, #f3ad79, #a95725)
        }

        .place {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #214773;
            margin: 0
        }

        .first .place {
            color: #9c7124
        }

        .place-en {
            font: 700 12px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: #8195af;
            direction: ltr;
            margin: 0 0 16px
        }

        .winner .name {
            margin: 0 auto 2px;
            max-width: 96%;
            min-height: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #113d77;
            line-height: 1.3
        }

        .winner .name-en {
            font: 12px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: #7186a1;
            direction: ltr;
            min-height: 0;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.3
        }

        .prize-tag {
            margin: 22px auto 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5ecf4;
            padding-top: 15px
        }

        .amount {
            font: 800 43px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: -1.2px;
            color: var(--blue);
            direction: ltr
        }

        .first .amount {
            font-size: 70px;
            color: #a46e14
        }

        .currency {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #627e98
        }

        .thankyou {
            margin-top: 39px;
            background: #e8f1fc;
            border: 1px solid #d7e5f6;
            border-radius: 27px;
            padding: 32px 36px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden
        }

        .thankyou:before,
        .thankyou:after {
            content: "✦";
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 95px;
            color: #bdd7f8;
            top: 26px
        }

        .thankyou:before {
            right: 25px
        }

        .thankyou:after {
            left: 25px
        }

        .thankyou h3 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: var(--navy);
            margin: 0 0 2px
        }

        .thankyou .sub {
            font: 700 17px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            direction: ltr;
            color: #4a719c;
            margin: 0 0 18px
        }

        .thankyou .closing {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #23568e;
            margin: 0
        }

        .thankyou .closing-en {
            font: 14px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: #6585a8;
            direction: ltr;
            margin: 5px 0 0
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 37px auto 0;
            padding-top: 22px;
            border-top: 1px solid #d8e5f2;
            max-width: 560px;
            color: #5b7a99
        }

        .footer b {
            display: block;
            color: #174875;
            font-size: 15px
        }

        .footer span {
            font: 11px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            direction: ltr;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px
        }

        .confetti {
            position: absolute;
            width: 10px;
            height: 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: #87b4e9;
            transform: rotate(-25deg);
            opacity: .75
        }

        .confetti.a {
            right: 10%;
            top: 20px
        }

        .confetti.b {
            left: 11%;
            top: 110px;
            background: #f2c86b
        }

        .confetti.c {
            left: 25%;
            top: 8px;
            height: 14px
        }

        .confetti.d {
            right: 22%;
            top: 105px;
            height: 12px
        }

        @media(max-width:720px) {
            .poster {
                margin: 0
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 37px 18px 112px
            }

            .logo {
                margin-bottom: 25px;
                width: 130px
            }

            .content {
                margin-top: -72px;
                padding: 0 14px 28px
            }

            .winners {
                gap: 7px
            }

            .winner {
                border-radius: 16px;
                padding: 30px 6px 19px;
                min-height: 272px
            }

            .winner.first {
                min-height: 303px;
                padding-top: 37px
            }

            .medal {
                height: 44px;
                width: 44px;
                font-size: 19px;
                margin: -10px auto 10px
            }

            .medal.gold {
                height: 56px;
                width: 56px;
                font-size: 24px
            }

            .place {
                font-size: 13px
            }

            .place-en {
                font-size: 9px;
                min-height: 24px
            }

            .winner .name {
                font-size: 14px;
                min-height: 0
            }

            .winner .name-en {
                font-size: 9px;
                min-height: 0
            }

            .prize-tag {
                margin-top: 12px;
                padding-top: 12px
            }

            .amount {
                font-size: 26px
            }

            .first .amount {
                font-size: 31px
            }

            .currency {
                font-size: 11px
            }

            .thankyou {
                padding: 23px 12px;
                border-radius: 18px;
                margin-top: 25px
            }

            .thankyou:before,
            .thankyou:after {
                font-size: 36px;
                top: 13px
            }

            .thankyou:before {
                right: 9px
            }

            .thankyou:after {
                left: 9px
            }

            .thankyou h3 {
                font-size: 22px
            }

            .thankyou .sub {
                font-size: 12px
            }

            .thankyou .closing {
                font-size: 16px
            }

            .thankyou .closing-en {
                font-size: 11px
            }

            .footer {
                margin-top: 26px
            }
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: #fff
            }

            .poster {
                box-shadow: none;
                margin: 0
            }

            * {
                print-color-adjust: exact;
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact
            }
        }

        /* Actual user-provided Illustrator SVG icons */
        .rank-icon {
            width: 67px;
            height: 78px;
            margin: -20px auto 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: transparent;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 5px 6px rgba(11, 43, 85, .12));
        }

        .rank-icon svg {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: visible;
            background: transparent;
        }

        .rank-icon.gold {
            width: 89px;
            height: 99px;
            color: #b98523;
            margin-top: -31px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 7px 9px rgba(157, 103, 20, .22));
        }

        .rank-icon.silver {
            color: #8896a9;
        }

        .rank-icon.bronze {
            color: #b66f46;
        }

        @media (max-width:720px) {
            .rank-icon {
                width: 42px;
                height: 54px;
                margin: -12px auto 8px;
            }

            .rank-icon.gold {
                width: 55px;
                height: 64px;
                margin: -20px auto 8px;
            }
        }


        /* Original Illustrator confetti: embedded as one transparent SVG, both sides */
        .thankyou {
            isolation: isolate;
            padding-left: 145px;
            padding-right: 145px;
        }

        .thankyou::before,
        .thankyou::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            width: 185px;
            height: 158px;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;base64,");
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-size: contain;
            opacity: .95;
            pointer-events: none;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .thankyou::before {
            right: 40px;
            transform: translateY(-50%) scaleX(-1);
        }

        .thankyou::after {
            left: 40px;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
        }

        .thankyou>* {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .thankyou .confetti {
            display: none;
        }

        @media(max-width:720px) {
            .thankyou {
                padding-left: 42px;
                padding-right: 42px;
            }

            .thankyou::before,
            .thankyou::after {
                width: 40px;
                height: 96px;
            }

            .thankyou::before {
                right: 1px;
            }

            .thankyou::after {
                left: 1px;
            }
        }

        /* Winner name editor: intentionally outside poster export */
        .editor-shell {
            max-width: 1480px;
            margin: 22px auto;
            padding: 0 18px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 320px minmax(0, 1fr);
            gap: 22px;
            align-items: start;
            direction: rtl
        }

        .editor-panel {
            position: sticky;
            top: 18px;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #dbe5f0;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 22px;
            box-shadow: 0 9px 32px #0b2d5412;
            direction: rtl;
            font-family: Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif
        }

        .editor-panel h2 {
            color: #00326d;
            font-size: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 7px;
            line-height: 1.5
        }

        .editor-help {
            color: #7086a1;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin: 0 0 18px
        }

        .editor-group {
            border: 1px solid #e5edf6;
            border-radius: 13px;
            margin: 0 0 13px;
            padding: 13px 12px 9px
        }

        .editor-group legend {
            color: #07439b;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0 6px
        }

        .editor-group.first-group {
            background: #fffaf0;
            border-color: #f0dbb6
        }

        .editor-panel label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #57718c;
            margin: 0 0 4px
        }

        .editor-panel input {
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #d5e2ef;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: white;
            color: #17395f;
            font: 400 14px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            padding: 10px 11px;
            outline: none;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            direction: rtl
        }

        .editor-panel input[lang=en] {
            direction: ltr;
            text-align: left
        }

        .editor-panel input:focus {
            border-color: #137ac9;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #137ac91a
        }

        .editor-panel .export-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            display: block;
            margin: 7px 0
        }

        .editor-panel select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #d5e2ef;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #fff;
            color: #17395f;
            font: 13px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif
        }

        .export-button {
            background: #07439b;
            color: #fff;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 11px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            font: 700 15px Ping, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 13px
        }

        .export-button:hover {
            background: #00326d
        }

        .export-button:disabled {
            opacity: .6;
            cursor: wait
        }

        .export-status {
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #5f7793;
            min-height: 24px;
            margin-top: 10px
        }

        .export-status.error {
            color: #a33838
        }

        .editor-tip {
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #8396ab;
            margin: 9px 0 0
        }

        .preview-area {
            min-width: 0;
            direction: rtl
        }

        .preview-area .poster {
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 1080px;
            width: 100%
        }

        /* Keep the original poster design as it is, with only long-name wrapping safeguards. */
        .winner .name,
        .winner .name-en {
            overflow-wrap: anywhere
        }

        @media(max-width:1200px) {
            .editor-shell {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 1100px
            }

            .editor-panel {
                position: static
            }

            .editor-fields {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
                gap: 10px
            }

            .editor-group {
                margin: 0
            }

            .editor-bottom {
                max-width: 420px
            }
        }

        @media(max-width:650px) {
            .editor-shell {
                padding: 0;
                gap: 12px;
                margin: 0
            }

            .editor-panel {
                border-radius: 0;
                padding: 15px
            }

            .editor-fields {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr
            }

            .editor-bottom {
                max-width: none
            }
        }

        /* Saudi Riyal official artwork: left of amount, matching its exact color. */
        .prize-tag .amount-line {
            display: flex;
            direction: ltr;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .prize-tag .riyal-icon {
            display: block;
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            width: 30px;
            height: 39px;
            fill: #07439b;
        }

        .winner.first .prize-tag .riyal-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 61px;
            fill: #a46e14;
        }

        @media (max-width:720px) {
            .prize-tag .amount-line {
                gap: 4px;
            }

            .prize-tag .riyal-icon {
                width: 20px;
                height: 23px;
            }

            .winner.first .prize-tag .riyal-icon {
                width: 25px;
                height: 29px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="editor-shell" id="editor-shell">
        <aside class="editor-panel" aria-label="إدخال أسماء الفائزين">
            <h2>أسماء الفائزين</h2>
            <p class="editor-help">اكتب الأسماء بالعربي والإنجليزي، وستظهر التغييرات مباشرة على التصميم. لوحة التحرير لن
                تظهر في الصورة المحمّلة.</p>
            <div class="editor-fields">
                <fieldset class="editor-group first-group">
                    <legend>المركز الأول | 5,000 ريال</legend>
                    <label for="first-ar">الاسم بالعربي</label>
                    <input id="first-ar" data-target="name-first-ar" dir="rtl" autocomplete="off">
                    <label for="first-en">Name in English</label>
                    <input id="first-en" data-target="name-first-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" autocomplete="off">
                </fieldset>
                <fieldset class="editor-group">
                    <legend>المركز الثاني | 2,500 ريال</legend>
                    <label for="second-ar">الاسم بالعربي</label>
                    <input id="second-ar" data-target="name-second-ar" dir="rtl" autocomplete="off">
                    <label for="second-en">Name in English</label>
                    <input id="second-en" data-target="name-second-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" autocomplete="off">
                </fieldset>
                <fieldset class="editor-group">
                    <legend>المركز الثالث | 1,500 ريال</legend>
                    <label for="third-ar">الاسم بالعربي</label>
                    <input id="third-ar" data-target="name-third-ar" dir="rtl" autocomplete="off">
                    <label for="third-en">Name in English</label>
                    <input id="third-en" data-target="name-third-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" autocomplete="off">
                </fieldset>
            </div>
            <div class="editor-bottom">
                <label class="export-label" for="quality">دقة حفظ الصورة</label>
                <select id="quality">
                    <option value="3" selected>عالية جدًا · 3× (موصى بها)</option>
                    <option value="4">قصوى · 4× (ملف أكبر)</option>
                    <option value="2">عالية · 2×</option>
                </select>
                <button class="export-button" id="export-button" type="button">تحميل التصميم كصورة PNG</button>
                <p class="export-status" id="export-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
                <p class="editor-tip">التصدير بصيغة PNG دون ضغط فقدي. يجب الاتصال بالإنترنت لتحميل مكتبة التصدير في أول
                    استخدام، مع إبقاء ملفات Ping بجانب ملف HTML.</p>
            </div>
        </aside>
        <div class="preview-area">
            <main class="poster" id="poster">
                <header class="hero">
                    <img class="logo" alt="الرائدة | alraedah"
                        src="data:image/png;base64,">
                    <svg class="crown" viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M10 28 31 48 60 10 88 48 110 28 100 79H20Z" fill="#f4cc78" stroke="#ffe9ad"
                            stroke-width="3" />
                        <path d="M23 87h74" stroke="#f4cc78" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <circle cx="60" cy="10" r="7" fill="#fff2be" />
                        <circle cx="10" cy="28" r="6" fill="#fff2be" />
                        <circle cx="110" cy="28" r="6" fill="#fff2be" />
                    </svg>
                    <h1>لحظة التتويج!</h1>
                    <p class="hero-title-en" lang="en" dir="ltr">The Crowning Moment!</p>
                    <h2>الفائزين بالجوائز الكبرى</h2>
                    <p class="hero-subtitle-en" lang="en" dir="ltr">The Grand Prize Winners</p>
                    <span class="star a">✦</span><span class="star b">✦</span><span class="star c">✧</span>
